{
  "an3.33:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.33 ",
  "an3.33:0.2": "4. Devadūtavagga ",
  "an3.33:0.3": "Sāriputtasutta ",
  "an3.33:1.1": "Atha kho āyasmā sāriputto yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho āyasmantaṁ sāriputtaṁ bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "an3.33:1.2": "“saṅkhittenapi kho ahaṁ, sāriputta, dhammaṁ deseyyaṁ; ",
  "an3.33:1.3": "vitthārenapi kho ahaṁ, sāriputta, dhammaṁ deseyyaṁ; ",
  "an3.33:1.4": "saṅkhittavitthārenapi kho ahaṁ, sāriputta, dhammaṁ deseyyaṁ; ",
  "an3.33:1.5": "aññātāro ca dullabhā”ti. ",
  "an3.33:1.6": "“Etassa, bhagavā, kālo, etassa, sugata, kālo ",
  "an3.33:1.7": "yaṁ bhagavā saṅkhittenapi dhammaṁ deseyya, vitthārenapi dhammaṁ deseyya, saṅkhittavitthārenapi dhammaṁ deseyya. ",
  "an3.33:1.8": "Bhavissanti dhammassa aññātāro”ti. ",
  "an3.33:2.1": "“Tasmātiha, sāriputta, evaṁ sikkhitabbaṁ: ",
  "an3.33:2.2": "‘imasmiñca saviññāṇake kāye ahaṅkāramamaṅkāramānānusayā na bhavissanti, bahiddhā ca sabbanimittesu ahaṅkāramamaṅkāramānānusayā na bhavissanti, yañca cetovimuttiṁ paññāvimuttiṁ upasampajja viharato ahaṅkāramamaṅkāramānānusayā na honti tañca cetovimuttiṁ paññāvimuttiṁ upasampajja viharissāmā’ti. ",
  "an3.33:2.3": "Evañhi kho, sāriputta, sikkhitabbaṁ. ",
  "an3.33:3.1": "Yato ca kho, sāriputta, bhikkhuno imasmiñca saviññāṇake kāye ahaṅkāramamaṅk